translate italian whitneyparkstartdate_132b2708:

    # "Whitney and I make our way around the trails, chit-chatting for a while."
    "Io e Whitney percorriamo i sentieri, chiacchierando un po’."

# game/Scenes/Whitney/WhitneyDates/whitneyparkdate.rpy:35
translate italian whitneyparkstartdate_236ab045:

    # "Eventually, we reach the bench halfway along the trail."
    "Alla fine, raggiungiamo la panchina a metà del sentiero."

# game/Scenes/Whitney/WhitneyDates/whitneyparkdate.rpy:41
translate italian whitneyparkstartdate_c7d49adf:

    # "I sit on the bench and she sits next to me. We hold hands and watch the sky change colors as the sun sets."
    "Mi siedo sulla panchina e lei si siede accanto a me. Ci teniamo per mano e guardiamo il cielo cambiare colore mentre il sole tramonta."

# game/Scenes/Whitney/WhitneyDates/whitneyparkdate.rpy:45
translate italian whitneyparkstartdate_1afd758f:

    # "Then I lean over and kiss her and we start making out."
    "Poi mi chino verso di lei e la bacio, e iniziamo a baciarci appassionatamente."

# game/Scenes/Whitney/WhitneyDates/whitneyparkdate.rpy:46
translate italian whitneyparkstartdate_6e33dba8:

    # "She's inexperienced, but she's really into it. She kisses with passion and desire. I can tell she wants more."
    "È inesperta, ma ci sta davvero dentro. Bacia con passione e desiderio. Capisco che ne vuole ancora."

# game/Scenes/Whitney/WhitneyDates/whitneyparkdate.rpy:47
translate italian whitneyparkstartdate_af7c35f8:

    # "But we have to head back before it gets too dark."
    "Ma dobbiamo tornare indietro prima che faccia troppo buio."

# game/Scenes/Whitney/WhitneyDates/whitneyparkdate.rpy:50
translate italian whitneyparkstartdate_6524e8a6:

    # wt "This has been really nice, [pcname]."
    wt "È stato davvero bello, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Whitney/WhitneyDates/whitneyparkdate.rpy:51
translate italian whitneyparkstartdate_c024991e:

    # wt "Thank you for taking me out. I really should get out in nature more often."
    wt "Grazie per avermi portato fuori. Dovrei davvero stare più spesso a contatto con la natura."

